:: Stolen Clothing Shop Result
<<effects>>
<<ShowUnderEquip "over">>
<<ShowUnderEquip "normal">>
<<if currentSkillValue('skulduggery') lt 100>>
	A security guard watches the entrance. There's no other way out, so you put everything back before leaving.
	<<clothingReset>>
<<else>>
	<<rng>>
	<<if crimeSumCurrent() gte 50000 or (crimeSumCurrent() gte 40000 and $rng * 20 gte currentSkillValue('skulduggery')) or (crimeSumCurrent() gte 25000 and $rng * 10 gte currentSkillValue('skulduggery'))
	or (crimeSumCurrent() gte 10000 and $rng * 5 gte currentSkillValue('skulduggery'))>>
		<<generateSecurity 1>><<person1>>
		A security guard watches the entrance, and as you try to stroll by, <<he>> stops you.
		<br><br>
		"So. I've been keeping an eye on you," <<he>> continues, "I'm letting you go this time, but you're going to be
		banned from the premises for a while. Hopefully this will help you learn why you shouldn't steal clothes."
		<<if $clothingShop.banCount lt 4>>
			<<set $clothingShop.ban to 7>>
		<<elseif $clothingShop.banCount lt 8>>
			<<set $clothingShop.ban to 10>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $clothingShop.ban to 14>>
		<</if>>
		<<crime "thievery">>
		<<set $clothingShop.banCount++>>
	<<else>>
		A security guard watches the entrance, but you stroll by without arousing suspicion.
		<<crime "thievery">>
	<</if>>
	<<set _crime to ($tryOn.value / 100)>>
	<<crimeUp _crime "thievery">>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Shopping Centre Top]]>><<set $tryOn.autoReset to true>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Stolen Jewellery Store Result
<<effects>>
<<ShowUnderEquip "over">>
<<ShowUnderEquip "normal">>
<<set _theftValue to $tryOn.value>>
<<if currentSkillValue('skulduggery') lt 200>>
	A security guard watches the jewellery store entrance. There's no other way out, so you put everything back before leaving.
	<<clothingReset>>
<<else>>
	<<rng>>
	<<if crimeSumCurrent() gte 40000 or (crimeSumCurrent() gte 30000 and $rng * 16 gte currentSkillValue('skulduggery')) or (crimeSumCurrent() gte 15000 and $rng * 8 gte currentSkillValue('skulduggery'))
	or (crimeSumCurrent() gte 5000 and $rng * 4 gte currentSkillValue('skulduggery'))>>
		<<generateSecurity 1>><<person1>>
		A security guard watches the jewellery store entrance, and as you try to stroll by, <<he>> stops you.
		<br><br>
		"So. I've been keeping an eye on you," <<he>> continues, "and this isn't the place to try something that bold. You're banned until the owners say otherwise."
		<<if $clothingShop.banCount lt 4>>
			<<set $clothingShop.ban to 10>>
		<<elseif $clothingShop.banCount lt 8>>
			<<set $clothingShop.ban to 14>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $clothingShop.ban to 21>>
		<</if>>
		<<crime "thievery">>
		<<set $clothingShop.banCount++>>
	<<else>>
		A security guard watches the jewellery store entrance, but you stroll by without arousing suspicion.
		<<crime "thievery">>
	<</if>>
	<<set _crime to (_theftValue / 50)>>
	<<crimeUp _crime "thievery">>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Shopping Centre Top]]>><<set $tryOn.autoReset to true>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Clothing Shop Guard
<<effects>>
<<generateSecurity 1>><<person1>>
<<if playerIsXChanged() and $xchange_fame lt 700>>
	<<if $xchange_fame lt 200>>
		The security guard watches you enter without reacting. <span class="green">Your X-Changed appearance does not match the person <<he>> was told to stop.</span>
	<<elseif $xchange_fame lt 400>>
		The security guard looks you over twice, then steps aside. <span class="teal">You seem familiar, but <<he>> cannot place you.</span>
	<<else>>
		The security guard watches you suspiciously, but cannot be sure enough to stop you. <span class="pink">You feel <<his>> eyes follow you into the shop.</span>
		<<if !$daily.xchangeShopBanSuspicion>>
			<<set $daily.xchangeShopBanSuspicion to true>><<crimeUp 5 "trespassing">>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	A security guard watches the entrance and spots you. <<He>> says a few words to someone you can't see, then approaches you.
	<br><br>
	"Sorry, can't let you pass," <<he>> says. "You still have <<if $clothingShop.ban gt 1>><<number $clothingShop.ban>> days<<else>>another day<</if>>
	till your ban is lifted."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if playerIsXChanged() and $xchange_fame lt 600>>
	<<link [[Enter|Clothing Shop]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Next|Shopping Centre Top]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Jewellery Store Guard
<<effects>>
<<generateSecurity 1>><<person1>>
<<if playerIsXChanged() and $xchange_fame lt 600>>
	<<if $xchange_fame lt 250>>
		The security guard watches you enter without reacting. <span class="green">Your X-Changed appearance does not match the person <<he>> was told to stop.</span>
	<<elseif $xchange_fame lt 500>>
		The security guard looks you over twice, then steps aside. <span class="teal">You seem familiar, but <<he>> cannot place you.</span>
	<<else>>
		The security guard watches you suspiciously, but cannot be sure enough to stop you. <span class="pink">You feel <<his>> eyes follow you into the store.</span>
		<<if !$daily.xchangeShopBanSuspicion>>
			<<set $daily.xchangeShopBanSuspicion to true>><<crimeUp 5 "trespassing">>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Enter|Jewellery Store]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	A security guard watches the entrance and spots you. <<He>> says a few words to someone you can't see, then approaches you.
	<br><br>
	"Sorry, can't let you pass," <<he>> says. "You still have <<if $clothingShop.ban gt 1>><<number $clothingShop.ban>> days<<else>>another day<</if>> till your ban is lifted."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Shopping Centre Top]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Clothing Shop Sneak Guard
<<effects>>
You spot a guard right by the entrance. It doesn't look like you'll be able to sneak past.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Shopping Centre Top]]>><</link>>

:: Clothing Shop Night Guard Found
<<effects>>
<<generateSecurity 1>><<person1>>
<<set $clothingShop.banCount++>>
<<set $clothingShop.spotted to false>>
After making sure that you close the shop's door as quietly as you can, you turn around and are shocked to
find a security guard face to face with you. <<He>> places a hand on your shoulder before you can even think of running.
<br><br>
"What do we have here? A little rat thief, trying to make off with some fine embroidery?" <<he>> says with a
disapproving expression. "I'll be informing the owners of this situation."
<br><br>
<<He>> pulls out <<his>> phone and seems to call the shop owners.
<<if $clothingShop.ban gt 0>>
	<<set $clothingShop.banExtension to true>>
	<<set $clothingShop.ban += 7>>
	"Aha! So you already have a ban in place," <<he>> continues. "They do have a rather strict banning policy,
	so it's going to be a good while before you're going to be able to shop here."
<<else>>
	<<if $clothingShop.banCount lt 4>>
		<<set $clothingShop.ban to 7>>
	<<elseif $clothingShop.banCount lt 8>>
		<<set $clothingShop.ban to 10>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $clothingShop.ban to 14>>
	<</if>>
	"That should do it," <<he>> continues. "Well. You won't be entering this establishment for quite some time. You aren't getting into the jewellery store either.
	Hopefully this will teach you a lesson."
<</if>>
<br><br>
"Now follow me, I'll be escorting you out of here. You're lucky that I don't just take you straight to the pillory."
<<tryOnReset>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Run|Clothing Shop Night Guard Found Run]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 500>>
<br>
<<link [[Follow the guard|Clothing Shop Night Guard Found Follow]]>><</link>>

:: Jewellery Store Night Guard Found
<<effects>>
<<generateSecurity 1>><<person1>>
<<set $clothingShop.banCount++>>
<<set $clothingShop.spotted to false>>
After making sure that you close the shop's door as quietly as you can, you turn around and are shocked to
find a security guard face to face with you. <<He>> places a hand on your shoulder before you can even think of running.
<br><br>
"What do we have here? A little rat thief, trying to make off with some fine embroidery?" <<he>> says with a
disapproving expression. "I'll be informing the owners of this situation."
<br><br>
<<He>> pulls out <<his>> phone and seems to call the shop owners.
<<if $clothingShop.ban gt 0>>
	<<set $clothingShop.banExtension to true>>
	<<set $clothingShop.ban += 7>>
	"Aha! So you already have a ban in place," <<he>> continues. "They do have a rather strict banning policy,
	so it's going to be a good while before you're going to be able to shop here."
<<else>>
	<<if $clothingShop.banCount lt 4>>
		<<set $clothingShop.ban to 7>>
	<<elseif $clothingShop.banCount lt 8>>
		<<set $clothingShop.ban to 10>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $clothingShop.ban to 14>>
