:: Clothing Shop Night Guard Found Run
<<effects>>
You decide to run and hide.
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	The security guard attempts to fully grab you, but you're able to avoid <<him>> just enough to get away.
	You run to the rooftop with <<him>> shouting in the distance.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Roof|Commercial rooftops]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	However, before being able to get past the security guard, <<he>> pulls on you hard enough for you to fall right on your ass.
	<br><br>
	"You'll regret trying to run from me," <<he>> says with a grin on <<his>> face. "There aren't any cameras here."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Clothing Shop Night Guard Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Clothing Shop Night Guard Found Follow
<<effects>>
<<He>> directs you towards the exit.
<<if random(0,100) gte 50>>
	"You know what?" <<he>> questions. "There aren't any cameras in this spot."
	<br><br>
	You look at <<him>> with a worried expression just before <<he>> grabs hold of you.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Clothing Shop Night Guard Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	You walk down the stairs in silence and as you reach the main entrance to the Shopping Centre,
	the guard opens the door for you.
	<br><br>
	"I hope this is a good lesson for you." <<He>> smiles. "You should look for more honest ways of
	earning money. Less trouble that way for everyone."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> locks the door as you leave.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Leave|High Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Clothing Shop Night Guard Molestation

<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<maninit>>
	<<set $enemytrust -= 40>>
	<<set $enemyanger += 40>>
	<<set $NPCList[0].lefthand to "arms">>
	<<set $leftarm to "grappled">>
	<<set $rightarm to "grappled">>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<man>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Clothing Shop Night Guard Molestation Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Clothing Shop Night Guard Molestation]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Clothing Shop Night Guard Molestation Finish

<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	You're able to hurt <<him>> enough to get away. <<tearful>> you flee the shop.
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Roof|Commercial rooftops]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<elseif $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	"Well, that was fun," <<he>> says, "but I think it's time for you to leave."
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Leave|High Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	/* No decisive outcome, such as giving up the encounter. */
	<<He>> loses interest in you. "Time for you to leave," <<he>> says.
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.<<set $combatExtended.blockingActive to 0>><<encounterEndViolence>>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Leave|High Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Jewellery Store Lock
<<effects>>
<<if $clothingShop.ban gt 0 and $clothingShop.banExtension is true>>
	You start toward the jewellery store, but the shopping centre's security presence is still heavy. Someone's eyes are on you the whole way, and slipping inside unnoticed doesn't feel possible right now.
	<br><br>
	<<icon "jewellery.png">><<link [[Continue|Clothing Shop Sneak Guard]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	You make your way to the jewellery store. Glass displays glitter behind the window with rings, chains, and watches arranged with careful precision.
	<br><br>
	<<if Time.hour lt 6 or Time.hour gte 21>>
		The shutters are down and the lights are off. A small sign lists the opening hours. You'll have to come back later.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Back|Shopping Centre Top]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		The door isn't locked. You can step inside whenever you're ready.
		<br><br>
		<<icon "jewellery.png">>
		<<if Story.has("Jewellery Store (0:01)")>>
			<<link [[Enter|Jewellery Store (0:01)]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
		<<elseif Story.has("Jewellery Store")>>
			<<link [[Enter|Jewellery Store]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			Something's off as there's no way to go more deep inside.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Back|Shopping Centre Top]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Leave|Shopping Centre Top]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Shop Trespass Payment Result
<<effects>>
<<if !$shopPaymentReturn>><<set $shopPaymentReturn to "Shopping Centre">><</if>>
<<set _goods to $shopPaymentGoods or "the goods">>
<<if $shopPaymentGenerous>>
	You leave <<printmoney $shopPaymentAmountShown>> for _goods, more than the tag asks for, and weigh it down where the staff will find it.
	<br><br>
	Getting inside was still illegal, but the extra money should make the morning discovery a little less grim.
<<else>>
	You count out <<printmoney $shopPaymentAmountShown>> for _goods and leave the money where the staff will find it.
	<br><br>
	Getting inside was still illegal, but at least the till won't be short.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|$shopPaymentReturn]]>>
	<<unset $shopPaymentAmountShown>>
	<<unset $shopPaymentGenerous>>
	<<unset $shopPaymentReturn>>
	<<unset $shopPaymentGoods>>
<</link>>
